  <description><![CDATA[ 




<p>From January to June 2026, I was a Visiting Graduate Student in the Department of Management, Society and Communication at Copenhagen Business School.</p>
<p>I work with Kristian Steensen Nielsen on an ongoing project on personal climate agency, contributing to data analysis and visualization.</p>
